From: mosip-vivid <vivid@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:26:08 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] liveness: Dart gate helper shared by all liveness call
 sites

runLivenessGate(context, workflow, matchUserId:) reads the effective policy,
requests the camera permission, runs LivenessOverlay full screen and, for
operator/supervisor authentication, matches the live face against the
user's enrolled face. Needs lib/liveness/liveness_{controller,overlay,
messages}.dart from mosip-vivid integration-android/flutter.
---
 lib/liveness/liveness_flow.dart | 181 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 181 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 lib/liveness/liveness_flow.dart

diff --git a/lib/liveness/liveness_flow.dart b/lib/liveness/liveness_flow.dart
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..0631b9c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/lib/liveness/liveness_flow.dart
@@ -0,0 +1,181 @@
